            "preview": "// Prepare a buffer whose bytes 1-3 match the skippable frame magic suffix. // First byte 0x00 does not have upper nibble 0x5, so this is not yet a valid frame. final byte[] signature = { 0, (byte) 0x2A, (byte) 0x4D, (byte) 0x18 };"
